============================================================================================
WHAT IT COSTS TO BE WRONG
============================================================================================
  if the effect is REAL      the gate adds   +43.5R over 333 days
  if the effect is NOISE     the cut group would have averaged the pool's +0.070,
                             so cutting 395 of them costs   -27.5R
  the bet is roughly symmetric in R and it is ALERTS ONLY — no
  capital moves on a label being wrong. that is the whole argument
  for shipping it before the forward sample exists.
